{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791737940, "covers_from": "2026-10-11T16:59:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-11T17:00:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791738000, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-11T16:59:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30396, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "希望可以改善寵物購買的制度！夜市後面都是賣寵物的，空間小也很擔心閉店後寵物們的生活環境！領養代替購買", "display_name": "大安代表 No.30,396", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T16:59:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30049, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "我北投,在市民專線反應工地擺三角錐不是圍給人走是自己停車,分局去一次後結案現在還是亂停,要出人命才懂", "display_name": "北投代表 No.30,049", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T16:59:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46819, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "勞工退休金未依據勞基法辦理，請問你就任市長後，會不會查辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.46,819", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T16:59:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2594, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "沒有動保區塊欸", "display_name": "大安代表 No.2,594", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-11T16:59:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 48754, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "每天新北往返於台北的時間，太塞了！\n捷運，乘車時間過長；公車，就會遇到大塞車，有無積極改善的方法？", "display_name": "信義代表 No.48,754", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30049, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.30,049", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 46819, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.46,819", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "fr